# OpenRouter's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-openrouter-setting-api-key = 来自 https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys 的 OpenRouter API 密钥（sk-or-v1-…）。也可使用管理 API 密钥，并额外读取最近 30 天的活动。
usage-openrouter-setting-management-api-key = 可选的管理 API 密钥，来自 https://openrouter.ai/settings/management-keys，仅用于读取最近 30 天的账号活动。
usage-openrouter-setting-base-url = 可选的代理 HTTPS API URL。默认为 https://openrouter.ai/api/v1。
usage-openrouter-setting-http-referer = 可选的客户端 URL，作为 HTTP-Referer 请求头发送。
usage-openrouter-setting-x-title = 可选的客户端标题，作为 X-Title 请求头发送。默认为 Sheprd。

## The report: the key's spending cap and spend, the account's prepaid
## credits, and, with a Management API key, the last 30 days of activity.
## The cap's reset window (such as monthly) stays as OpenRouter sends it.

usage-openrouter-credits = 点数
# The plan line of a free-tier key.
usage-openrouter-free-tier = 免费额度
usage-openrouter-last-30-days = 最近 30 天
usage-openrouter-spend = 支出
usage-openrouter-requests = 请求
usage-openrouter-tokens = Token
# How many models the account used in the last 30 days.
usage-openrouter-models = 模型
# A window: the key's spending cap, when it names no daily, weekly, or
# monthly reset.
usage-openrouter-api-key-limit = API 密钥限额
usage-openrouter-spending-cap = 支出上限
# The spending cap of a key without one.
usage-openrouter-no-limit = 未配置限额
usage-openrouter-cap-remaining = 上限剩余额度
usage-openrouter-key-used = 密钥已用额度
usage-openrouter-reset-window = 重置周期
usage-openrouter-today = 今天
usage-openrouter-this-week = 本周
usage-openrouter-this-month = 本月
# A section's title: the key's cap and spend.
usage-openrouter-api-key = API 密钥
